    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you survive the Card Gauntlet?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Gauntlet is a rougelike deckbuilding game that combines a linear dice board with RPG class skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose a Class and Specialization</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/8a77c8d00781e03229d0a4328847be7b.poster.avif?t=1743001159\" width=550 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/8a77c8d00781e03229d0a4328847be7b.webm?t=1743001159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/8a77c8d00781e03229d0a4328847be7b.mp4?t=1743001159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the Mage and Knight Class, you'll find 6 totally unique <strong>Specializations</strong> to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <strong>Specialization</strong> has a their own unique set of <strong>Skill Cards </strong>they can collect in a run. Level up your <strong>Specialization</strong> to unlock even more <strong>Skills Cards </strong>and help you beat the Gauntlet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect and Build a Unique Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/48054b94b11c4ef8eac32ecb4e1db848.poster.avif?t=1743001159\" width=550 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/48054b94b11c4ef8eac32ecb4e1db848.webm?t=1743001159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/48054b94b11c4ef8eac32ecb4e1db848.mp4?t=1743001159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 115\u00a0<strong>Skill Cards</strong> and <strong>Item Cards</strong> to collect, with hundreds of Deck combinations to choose from. Pick your favorite <strong>Class</strong> and <strong>Specialization</strong> to run with.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Your Way Through a Gauntlet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/3cce3f37828e2ed0a0b9039b194c0a36.poster.avif?t=1743001159\" width=550 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/3cce3f37828e2ed0a0b9039b194c0a36.webm?t=1743001159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/3cce3f37828e2ed0a0b9039b194c0a36.mp4?t=1743001159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>Skill Cards</strong>\u00a0to take on challenging Creatures across 5 Biomes. Unlock even more powerful  <strong>Talent Cards</strong>\u00a0that can turn the tide of battle for you. Randomly generated Gauntlets have different Creatures and Bosses to fight, so no two runs are the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you survive the Card Gauntlet?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Gauntlet is a rougelike deckbuilding game that combines a linear dice board with RPG class skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose a Class and Specialization</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/8a77c8d00781e03229d0a4328847be7b.poster.avif?t=1743001159\" width=550 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/8a77c8d00781e03229d0a4328847be7b.webm?t=1743001159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/8a77c8d00781e03229d0a4328847be7b.mp4?t=1743001159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the Mage and Knight Class, you'll find 6 totally unique <strong>Specializations</strong> to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <strong>Specialization</strong> has a their own unique set of <strong>Skill Cards </strong>they can collect in a run. Level up your <strong>Specialization</strong> to unlock even more <strong>Skills Cards </strong>and help you beat the Gauntlet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect and Build a Unique Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/48054b94b11c4ef8eac32ecb4e1db848.poster.avif?t=1743001159\" width=550 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/48054b94b11c4ef8eac32ecb4e1db848.webm?t=1743001159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/48054b94b11c4ef8eac